        },
        "chapterId": "3JN.1",
        "content": "Saboda haka in na zo, zan tone abin da yake yi, yana surutu game da mu, yana ɓaɓɓata mu. Wannan ma bai ishe shi ba, har yana ƙin marabtar ’yan’uwa. Yana hana waɗanda suke so yin haka, yana ma korinsu daga ikkilisiya.",
        "reference": "3 Yohanna 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
